# TypeScript

- ESM, Node 20+, strict TypeScript
- No `any` without a one-line justification comment
- Named exports; keep `src/cli.ts` thin
- Vitest for tests; colocate `*.test.ts` next to the unit or under `src/`
- Do not import from `dist/`
- Do not add frameworks or UI libraries
- Match existing file layout before creating new folders
